Domain StudentAcademicRecord
    documentation 'The Student Academic Record domain models the various kinds
                  'of student performance reporting.
                  '
                  '* A gradebook contains grades and competencies for classroom
                  'quizzes, tests, homework, and projects. An assignment in a
                  'Gradebook is represented as a GradebookEntry. Each student's
                  'score for that entry is a StudentGradebookEntry which can be
                  'a grade or a CompetencyLevelDescriptor.
                  '
                  '* Report cards contain information for grading period grades
                  'and competencies. A report card consists of a ReportCard entity
                  'for each GradingPeriod. A Grade is associated with each Section
                  'entity.
                  '
                  '* A student transcript contains information about course-level
                  'grades and credits. A student transcript consists of a
                  'StudentAcademicRecord associated with each Session which has a
                  'CourseTranscript for each course taken.
    domain item CompetencyObjective
    domain item Course
    domain item CourseOffering
    domain item CourseTranscript
    domain item EducationOrganization
    domain item Grade
    domain item GradebookEntry
    domain item GradingPeriod
    domain item LearningObjective
    domain item LearningStandard
    domain item Program
    domain item ReportCard
    domain item School
    domain item Section
    domain item Session
    domain item Student
    domain item StudentAcademicRecord
    domain item StudentCompetencyObjective
    domain item StudentGradebookEntry
    domain item StudentLearningObjective
    domain item StudentProgramAssociation
    domain item StudentSectionAssociation
